OL,3,GNEWSATrain journeys to be disrupted by
OL,4,Aweek-long works
OL,5,
OL,6,FA week-long disruption to train
OL,7,Fservices is due to affect passengers
OL,8,Ftravelling through Wiltshire.
OL,10,FTravellers have been warned that the
OL,11,Freplacement of sections of track near
OL,12,FPewsey will mean some journeys taking
OL,13,Flonger, and bus replacement services
OL,14,Fbeing used.
OL,16,FWorks will start Saturday 10 October
OL,17,Fwith disruption scheduled until Friday
OL,18,F16 October, affecting a number of
OL,19,Froutes.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
